<title>CANADA: Alberta Agriculture details crop growth to July 7.</title>
<headline>Alberta Agriculture details crop growth to July 7.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of crop growth to July 7.</p>
<p>CROP     TILLERED/ROSETTE SHOTBLADE/FLOWERED HEADED/PODDED</p>
<p>Spring Wheat  33 pct		 50 pct	    17 pct</p>
<p>Oats	    46 pct		 44 pct	     5 pct</p>
<p>Barley	  40 pct		 46 pct	    12 pct</p>
<p>Winter Wheat  --			4 pct	    96 pct</p>
<p>Fall Rye	 7 pct		  6 pct	    94 pct</p>
<p>Peas	    67 pct		 20 pct	    13 pct</p>
<p>Canola	  39 pct		 58 pct	     2 pct</p>
<p>Flax	    77 pct		 23 pct	     0 pct</p>
<p>((Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
